RallyPin is designed for motorsport fans, main app features are:
- Displaying active rallies on the map;
- Providing information about rally stages, entrants, timings and viewpoints;
- Navigator mode for helping users reach viewpoint of interest, stage start or finish, service park or podium.

Regio kaart – see on Baltimaade täpseim ja ajakohaseim kaardirakendus! Regio kaardirakendust saab kasutada nii nutiseadmes kui ka arvutis.

Rakenduses on saadaval navigeerimise võimalus ja vastavalt sõidusuunale kaardi pööramise funktsioon! 
Regio vektorkaart muudab kaardi kasutamise ja navigeerimise sujuvaks ja mugavaks.
Otsi aadresse, arvuta mitme peatusega teekondi, otsi külastamist väärivaid huviobjekte ja kuva kogu infot mugavalt Regio aluskaardil.


Regio kaart võimaldab: 
* navigeerida valitud sihtkohta. Vahepeatuste lisamise võimalus - läbi vahepunktide soovitud järjekorras või optimeeri punktide vaheline teekond; 
* vahetada aluskaardi tüüpi. Valikus on Regio vektorkaart, ortofoto ning hübriidkaart; 
* otsida ametlikke aadresse nii Eesti, Läti kui Leedu riigi piires; 
* pikema vajutuse (2-3 sek) korral avaneb asukohapunkti info (aadress ja koordinaadid) kaardil; 
* otsida koordinaatide järgi asukohta; 
* jälgida oma asukohta ning selle muutumist reaalajas; 
* oma asukoha punktile vajutades näha asukoha koordinaate WGS84 süsteemis; 
* joonlaua abil mõõta vahemaid; 
* kuvada aluskaarti sõidusuunas. Nutiseadmes saab kaarti pöörata-keerata kahe sõrme abil; 
* otsida huvi- ja teenindusobjekte kõigis Balti riikides. Kokku on üle 30 erineva kategooria huviobjekte. Objektile vajutades kuvatakse objekti info alates kontaktinfost lõpetades lahtiolekuaegadega. 


Rakenduse aluseks olevad ruumiandmed (aadressid, teekonnaarvutus, aluskaart ja huviobjektid) uuenevad igakuiselt.

Rakendus on kasutatav 15 erinevas keeles: eesti, inglise, saksa, hispaania, prantsuse, läti, leedu, poola, ukraina, soome, rootsi, vietnami, vene, hiina ja jaapani keeles.



Regio kaart (Regio map) is the most precise and up-to-date map application of the Baltic countries (Estonia, Latvia, Lithuania).
The Regio map application can be used  on a smart device as well as on a desktop. 

The application has navigation functionality and the function to turn the map according to the travel direction.
The Regio vector map makes the use and navigation of the map smooth and user-friendly.
Search for the exact address, navigate to your destination and add stops to your route, search for Point of Interest in a wide variety and see all of this information on Regio base map.


The application offers several useful features, such as: 
* navigation to desired destination. It is possible to add several stops, find the optimal route between them and navigate; 
* changing the base map type. Currently available: Regio vector map, orthophoto and hybrid map;  
* search of official addresses in Estonia, Latvia and Lithuania; 
* press-and-hold feature, which opens the location information (address and coordinates); 
* real-time positioning; 
* search for a location by coordinates; 
* the possibility to see location coordinates in the WGS84 system; 
* measuring the distance using ruler; 
* displaying the map in the driving direction. It is possible to rotate the map on the smartphone using two fingers; 
* search for the Point of Interest (POI) in all Baltic countries. There are over 30 different categories available.  By clicking on the POI detailed information about it can be seen. 


The data in the application (addresses, navigation information, map layers and POIs) is updated monthly. 

The application is usable in 15 different languages: Estonian, English, German, Spanish, French, Latvian, Lithuanian, Polish, Ukrainian, Finnish, Swedish, Vietnamese, Russian, Chinese, Japanese.

Miio app allows you to comfortably charge your electric vehicle in Portugal, France and Spain, get to know the final price beforehand and interact with the community. 

Miio makes it possible to:
- Charge your vehicle through the app or physical card;
- Have full control over your expenses, before, during and after your charging session;
- View the most complete charging station map, with power indicators, plug availability and type of venue;
- Get help to choose between charging stations and plugs, according to your vehicle specificities;
- Monitor your charging session from distance and in real time, with smart alarms; 
- Comment, rate and add photos to charging stations;
- Be notified about state and price changes, or about new stations; 
- Save your favorite or recent charging stations;
- Plan your trips: where to stop and charge, how long it will take and how much it will cost you;
- Earn bonus with our campaigns;
And much more!
